+   reuse of that numeric extent is permitted in this process lifetime.
+   Raw free/realloc/usable-size access after custody return remains invalid.
+   Retained numeric ranges route to bounded refusal without arena access;
+   this supplies no pointer-generation authentication or reuse authority.  */
