+/* Linux x86-64 LP64.  All writable outputs must be outside every retained
+   metadata/application arena, stack and fixed registry.  No block or admitted address is reused
+   during this process lifetime; callers enforce exactly-once last reference
+   for raw free.  Checked release additionally authenticates allocation id.  */
